<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Jan-Sept corn output seen up 5.49 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippine Jan-Sept corn output seen up 5.49 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines corn production is seen rising by 5.49 percent to 3.46 million tonnes for the first nine months of the year from 3.28 million tonnes a year earlier, the Bureau of Agricultural Statistics said on Friday.</p>
<p>The state-agency said the growth may be attributed to an estimated 3.25 percent improvement in yield per hectare and a 1.78 percent expansion in hectarage.</p>
</text>
